# Applies to every docker build run from the repo root (docker/polywire and docker/polyadvisor's
# docker-compose.yml files both set `context: ../..`) -- classic Docker behavior only honors a
# .dockerignore at the build context root, not next to the Dockerfile, so this is the one place it
# needs to live for both modules. Mirrors .gitignore's own exclusions.

**/target/
**/dependency-reduced-pom.xml
**/*.class

advisor/web/node_modules/
advisor/web/dist/
advisor/web/.vite/

.git/
.DS_Store
*.log
